      "note": "PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, non-author reconciler with retained campaign and tooling context. The opening 'o na is a complete discourse recast at d3. Ma owns the contracted negative n't at d6 with explicit subword intent; would/be and According to you remain unwrapped. The first numeral/body-part description is distributed across four limbs and a head; it is omitted, not nulled. The later lngas is retained whole as five, with no split bound s. The two gis agentive roles are fused with English subject syntax. No source text or dictionary gloss is changed."
